Layer Explanation
Spring Data JPA: Simplifies database access by providing repository interfaces and automatic CRUD functionality.
JPA: Defines standard APIs and annotations for object-relational mapping.
Hibernate: Implements JPA and performs ORM, SQL generation, caching, and transaction management.
JDBC & Database: Executes SQL queries and stores application data.
